### 1. Registrar
POST http://localhost:8000/api/register
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Saulo",
  "email": "saulo@teste.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "password_confirmation": "12345678"
}

### 2. Listar entregas (precisa de token)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/entregas
Accept: application/json
Authorization: COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "saulo@teste.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### Criar entrega
POST http://localhost:8000/api/entregas
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
  "descricao": "Pizza",
  "endereco_coleta": "Rua Z, 350",
  "endereco_entrega": "Rua HG, 17",
  "valor": 99.90
}

### Listar pendentes
GET http://localhost:8000/api/entregas?status=pendente
Accept: application/json
Authorization: COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Ver minha entrega (esperado 200)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/entregas/22
Accept: application/json
Authorization: COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Ver entrega sem dono (esperado 403)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/entregas/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI